 "notes": "Figures in US dollars, converted from US$m. Revenue, cost of providing services and sale of goods, and operating result are for continuing operations as printed. Operating Expenses combines selling, general and administration expenses with other losses and gains net, so gross profit less operating expenses equals the printed operating loss of 217m (FY2025 profit of 124m). Net Finance Costs combines interest expense, interest income and other finance costs net. Profit before taxation is far above the operating result because it includes the share of equity accounted results (mainly Tencent), gains on partial disposal of equity accounted investments and net gains on acquisitions and disposals. Net Profit is attributable to equity holders of the group; profit for the year including non-controlling interests was 11,573m and 12,255m. Basic EPS is 633 and 613 US cents on total operations after the five for one share split completed in October 2025. FY2024 to FY2022 columns are carried from the previous secondary-feed snapshot, not from this filing.",
